        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the unforgiving frontiers of deep space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Space base Defense</i>, you're the commander of a stranded lander under constant siege by alien creatures. Your mission is simple: <strong>gather, build, and survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lighthearted and tactical tower defense game where you gather resources, create and upgrade different types of units to fend off endless waves of enemies.</strong> Collect, create, and position strategically to survive each attack in colorful alien environments full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest glowing blue gems from the planet's crust to construct an army of mining bots, defensive- and combat units. Fend off endless waves of alien enemies who drop green gems upon defeat — your key to unlocking new planets and tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every planet offers new layouts, fresh enemies, and the chance to perfect your strategy. Will your base become a shining beacon of survival or fall beneath the alien swarm?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Base Defense</strong> — Protect your lander at all costs against incoming alien waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine and Build</strong> — Collect blue gems to expand your defense and create new units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan Your Growth</strong> — Balance resource gathering with firepower to outlast the enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Worlds</strong> — Defeat alien invaders, collect green gems, and unlock new planets to explore and conquer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple to Learn, Hard to Master</strong> — Easy to pick up, but challenging to survive!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the unforgiving frontiers of deep space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Space base Defense</i>, you're the commander of a stranded lander under constant siege by alien creatures. Your mission is simple: <strong>gather, build, and survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lighthearted and tactical tower defense game where you gather resources, create and upgrade different types of units to fend off endless waves of enemies.</strong> Collect, create, and position strategically to survive each attack in colorful alien environments full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest glowing blue gems from the planet's crust to construct an army of mining bots, defensive- and combat units. Fend off endless waves of alien enemies who drop green gems upon defeat — your key to unlocking new planets and tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every planet offers new layouts, fresh enemies, and the chance to perfect your strategy. Will your base become a shining beacon of survival or fall beneath the alien swarm?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Base Defense</strong> — Protect your lander at all costs against incoming alien waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine and Build</strong> — Collect blue gems to expand your defense and create new units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan Your Growth</strong> — Balance resource gathering with firepower to outlast the enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Worlds</strong> — Defeat alien invaders, collect green gems, and unlock new planets to explore and conquer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple to Learn, Hard to Master</strong> — Easy to pick up, but challenging to survive!</p></li></ul>",
